{"about_the_game":"Town Squared is a peaceful city building and puzzle game, where you place buildings in different layouts to create the happiest town you can. Relax and play with tiny towns, building fun architecture guided by soft rules.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1383910/extras/aaf582084d0a57953faa25cf74f8215c.webp?t=1764543553\" width=205 height=10 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1383910/extras/2f8bd4a5a17a7ac17b11340766cde2f3.poster.avif?t=1764543553\" width=200 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1383910/extras/2f8bd4a5a17a7ac17b11340766cde2f3.webm?t=1764543553\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1383910/extras/2f8bd4a5a17a7ac17b11340766cde2f3.mp4?t=1764543553\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>The gameplay at the heart of Town Squared is about dropping buildings onto your town in specific patterns. The more patterns you fulfill, the happier your townfolk are, and the more buildings you unlock to build bigger towns.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1383910/extras/8e0cf68b38111755e1e2ac6bed61fc53.webp?t=1764543553\" width=225 height=10 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1383910/extras/2d7989b2ed30d6845a474c2866dde57a.poster.avif?t=1764543553\" width=160 height=160 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1383910/extras/2d7989b2ed30d6845a474c2866dde57a.webm?t=1764543553\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"htt